    "title": "📅 Senior Coffee: Learn about Sullivan County aging services",
    "text": "9 hours ago 📅 Learn about senior services over coffee in Liberty\nJoin the Senior Coffee - Office for the Aging talk on Monday, October 5, 2026, from 10:30–11:30am at the Program Room, 189 North Main St, Liberty, NY 12754 .\nKelly Brown , Coordinator of Services for the Sullivan County Office for the Aging , will be the guest speaker. She’ll go over the different programs and services the agency offers and leave plenty of time for questions .\nThis is an in-person adult program , a good fit for older adults, caregivers, and family members who want to better understand what help and resources are available for seniors in Sullivan County.\nMore Info: Senior Coffee - Office for the Aging - ...\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
    "summary": "9 hours ago 📅 Learn about senior services over coffee in Liberty Join the Senior Coffee - Office for the Aging talk on Monday, October 5, 2026, from 10:30–11:30am at the Program Room, 189 North Main St, Liberty, NY 12754 . Kelly Brown , Coordinator of Services for the Sullivan County Office for the Aging , will be the guest speaker. She’ll go over the different programs and services the agency offers and leave plenty of time for questions .",
